      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "40% of the things you're consuming are poisoned.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2061246599897182717",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-01T00:41:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It\u2019s fascinating how a drug designed for weight loss is suddenly making people rethink shopping, drinking, gambling, social media\u2026 even pleasure itself.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2060882702249910489",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-31T00:35:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Is Hasan Piker the Joe Rogan of the left?\n\n\nWhat Now? with Trevor Noah (@WhatNowPodcast)\n\n\u201cThe left needs a Joe Rogan.\u201d\nPeople have been saying that for years.\n\nSo what happens when Hasan Piker gets asked directly if he\u2019s that person?\n\nOne of the most interesting parts of the episode.\n\nWatch the full conversation now on YouTube.\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/WhatNowPodcast/status/2060428207267197040#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2060832667210506726",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-30T21:16:10+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The internet has taught me that the moment someone says \u201cthat\u2019s going to be clipped,\u201d it\u2019s already too late. \ud83d\ude02\n\nWatch the full conversation on my YouTube channel now!\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2060549255685673422",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-30T02:30:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It's a strange feeling when you're told things are getting better... while everything around you keeps getting more expensive.\n\nWatch the full conversation with Hasan Piker on my YouTube channel.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2060502312939069469",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-29T23:23:28+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Is Your Job Safe?\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2060181079055872455",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-29T02:07:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I asked Hasan how he feels about being\ncalled \u201cthe Joe Rogan of the left,\" and somehow we\nended up discussing podcast culture, political\nmessaging, CNN energy, elk hunting, and whether\n\u201cgoon\u201d is an acceptable adult insult. \ud83d\ude02\n\nReally fascinating conversation. \n\nFull episode is up now on my YouTube channel. \n\n#HasanPiker #JoeRogan #WhatNowPodcast\n#TrevorNoah\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2060035874864197650",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-28T16:30:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Is Gen Z Killing the Art of Waiting?\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2059824982721790122",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-28T02:32:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Wil started telling me about his parents escaping Haiti and somehow the story transformed from Haitian Romeo &amp; Juliet into Haitian Terminator \ud83d\ude33\n\nWatch the full conversation now on my YouTube channel.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2059674239314342110",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-27T16:33:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Not every angry comment is personal. Sometimes people are just joining the noise because everyone else is.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2059459574793400560",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-27T02:20:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Wil casually told me he invented \u201csolar powered paint\u201d in 1994 and for a solid minute I genuinely couldn\u2019t tell if I was speaking to a genius or a man confidently making things up \ud83d\ude02\n\nThe full episode is out now on my YouTube channel.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2059311096545378530",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-26T16:30:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
